	(property "Design notes" "Upgraded for local Pico and ADC load. TMR 3-0511 single output: 5 V / 600 mA, 3 W, input 4.5 to 9 V. Remote pin 3 open means ON. Pin 4 is absent; physical pins 5 and 8 are NC. Pin 6 is +5, pin 7 is channel MID. Keep primary isolated. Custom footprint follows the visually checked official 15-Apr-2026 SIP8 drawing; verify a physical part before assembly."
